{
  "id": "c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "The value of the arts",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what role does art or music play in your life?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think creativity can be taught?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you remember about art or music lessons at school?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, is there a cultural event you would travel a long way to see?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e05-a1",
            "c1-e05-a2",
            "c1-e05-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people involved in the arts. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might get out of these activities, and how important the activities might be for society.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these activities do you think receives too little support?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e05-b1",
            "c1-e05-b2",
            "c1-e05-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people enjoying art in public. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might enjoy about these experiences, and why art might be important in public places.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 14100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think art is easier to appreciate in a gallery or in a public place?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways in which the arts contribute to society, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might the arts contribute to the well-being of a community?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most valuable?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about the role of the arts in society.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should governments subsidise the arts, or should they be able to survive on their own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think the arts are undervalued compared with science and technology?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is artistic talent something you are born with or something you can develop?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent has technology democratised the creation of art?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should art that offends some people be allowed in public spaces?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it that young people have access to the arts?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e05-the-value-of-the-arts/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
